---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "David Bograd: Product Designer"
socialImage: david-bush.jpg
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__intro">
        <p class="eyebrow hero__eyebrow">
          <span class="hero__status" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {{ site.role }} &nbsp;/&nbsp; {{ site.location }}
        </p>

        <h1 class="hero__title">
          I&rsquo;m a Danish Product Designer living in Perth, Australia.
          I make a positive impact through <em>great design</em>.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero__body">
          Currently at <a href="https://simplywall.st/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Simply Wall St</a>
          making investing easier for 7M users. Previously at
          <a href="https://envato.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Envato</a>
          (now part of Shutterstock).
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero__portrait">
        {% image "david-bush.jpg", "David Bograd", "portrait", true %}
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="work">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-head__title">Work</h2>
      <div class="section-head__meta">
        <span class="section-head__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="section-head__sub">In-depth cases of my latest work</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-grid">
      {% for item in collections.casesVisible %}
      <article class="case-card reveal" style="--case-accent: {{ item.data.accent }}">
        <div class="case-card__media">
          {% if loop.first %}
            {% image item.data.thumb, "", "thumbWide", true %}
          {% else %}
            {% image item.data.thumb, "", "thumb" %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="case-card__body">
          <div class="case-card__tags">
            {% for tag in item.data.tags_display %}
            <span class="eyebrow case-card__tag">
              {% if loop.first %}<span class="case-card__dot"></span>{% endif %}{{ tag }}
            </span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>

          <h3 class="case-card__title">{{ item.data.cardTitle }}</h3>

          <span class="case-card__cta">
            Read case study
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m0 0-6-6m6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>

        <a class="case-card__link" href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.cardTitle }}</a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-head__title">About me</h2>
      <div class="section-head__meta">
        <span class="section-head__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="section-head__sub">If you fancy reading more, here&rsquo;s my short story.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__aside">
        <figure class="about__photo">
          {% image "david-wall.jpg", "David Bograd", "aboutPhoto" %}
        </figure>

        <div class="about__contact">
          <p>Don&rsquo;t be a stranger&mdash;Reach me at</p>
          <a class="about__email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">&rarr; {{ site.email }}</a>
          <p class="about__ps">PS. I don&rsquo;t always pose awkwardly in front of walls.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__social">
          {% for link in site.social %}
          <a class="pill" href="{{ link.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ link.label }}</a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about__text">
        <p>
          I currently work at <a href="https://simplywall.st/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Simply Wall St</a>.
          We&rsquo;re making investing easier for over 7,000,000 users worldwide.
        </p>
        <p>
          Previously, I worked at <a href="https://envato.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Envato</a>
          where I built tools for Envato&rsquo;s marketplaces and contributors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Throughout my 10+ year of experience I&rsquo;ve worked for a handful of tech companies,
          designed websites for clients such as Microsoft, and freelanced for more than 100 clients.
        </p>
        <p>
          I&rsquo;m a self-taught Designer and had been working in the industry for a handful of years,
          before I went to Hyper Island where I studied Digital Data Strategy to broaden my skillset.
        </p>
        <p>
          When not working you can catch traveling and meeting new cultures. I like to stay active and
          spend time at the gym. If I&rsquo;m lucky and find a snowy mountain you&rsquo;d probably see me
          shredding slopes on my snowboard.
        </p>
        <p>I&rsquo;m based in Perth, Australia but originate from Copenhagen, Denmark.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
